{"5000320":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"ODDSTABLE","steam_appid":5000320,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"ODDSTABLE is a single-player, offline horse-racing odds roguelite built around reading incomplete information, committing to fixed prices, and surviving twelve races with virtual in-game coins.<br><br>Each race presents six horses drawn from a larger field. Compare public form, track conditions, fixed odds, and up to three pieces of private intel per horse. Decide what deserves your trust before the window closes.<br><br>Build up to three standard tickets, or stake everything on an exclusive ALL IN. Contracts can tighten those rules, cap your stake, demand a particular ticket structure, or forbid ALL IN entirely. Eight markets open across the tour: Win, Top Three, Head-to-Head, Last Place, First Two in Any Order, First Two in Exact Order, Comeback Winner, and First-and-Last.<br><br>Then watch the six-horse race unfold. Follow the live order into the final 100 metres and, when the margin is exceptionally close, a photo finish. At the Night Cashier, every locked price, contract modifier, and triggered charm is reconciled into one readable settlement.<br><br>Twenty-four underground contracts are spread across four invitation tiers—Visitor, Silver Seal, Gold Seal, and Black Gold. Between races, visit the backroom shop, reshape your charm collection, and choose how much risk to carry into the next three-race meeting. Complete the standard tour, or take on the Black Book tour for a more demanding route through the same twelve-race structure.<br><br>ODDSTABLE uses only virtual game coins. It contains no real-money betting, deposits, withdrawals, cash prizes, or in-game purchases.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A complete twelve-race single-player tour, divided into four three-race meetings.<br><\/li><li>Six horses in every race, selected from a larger data-driven horse pool.<br><\/li><li>Fixed odds, public form, track information, and up to three private intel slots per horse.<br><\/li><li>Eight markets unlocked progressively across the tour.<br><\/li><li>Up to three standard tickets or one exclusive ALL IN, with stricter rules imposed by some contracts.<br><\/li><li>Animated races with live order, a true distance-based final 100 metres, and photo finishes for exceptionally close margins.<br><\/li><li>Twenty-four underground contracts across Visitor, Silver Seal, Gold Seal, and Black Gold invitation tiers.<br><\/li><li>Charms, readable ticket settlement, an underground shop, stage bankroll targets, failure states, and completion routes.<br><\/li><li>Standard and Black Book twelve-race tours.<br><\/li><li>Interface languages: English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, and Korean.<br><\/li><li>Designed for offline play with local saves; no external AI service is used during gameplay.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO REAL-MONEY GAMBLING NOTICE<\/h2>ODDSTABLE is a fictional, single-player game played entirely with virtual in-game coins. It does not accept real-money bets, deposits, withdrawals, cash conversion, or cash prizes. It contains no in-game purchases. Its fixed odds and ticket systems are game mechanics and are not a gambling service or real-world racing prediction tool.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GENERATIVE AI DISCLOSURE<\/h2>Generative AI tools were used during development to assist with portions of pre-generated artwork, textures, icons, promotional imagery, and localization drafts. All such content was reviewed, edited, selected, and integrated by the developer before release. The game does not connect to external AI services and does not generate AI content during gameplay.","about_the_game":"ODDSTABLE is a single-player, offline horse-racing odds roguelite built around reading incomplete information, committing to fixed prices, and surviving twelve races with virtual in-game coins.<br><br>Each race presents six horses drawn from a larger field. Compare public form, track conditions, fixed odds, and up to three pieces of private intel per horse. Decide what deserves your trust before the window closes.<br><br>Build up to three standard tickets, or stake everything on an exclusive ALL IN. Contracts can tighten those rules, cap your stake, demand a particular ticket structure, or forbid ALL IN entirely. Eight markets open across the tour: Win, Top Three, Head-to-Head, Last Place, First Two in Any Order, First Two in Exact Order, Comeback Winner, and First-and-Last.<br><br>Then watch the six-horse race unfold. Follow the live order into the final 100 metres and, when the margin is exceptionally close, a photo finish. At the Night Cashier, every locked price, contract modifier, and triggered charm is reconciled into one readable settlement.<br><br>Twenty-four underground contracts are spread across four invitation tiers—Visitor, Silver Seal, Gold Seal, and Black Gold. Between races, visit the backroom shop, reshape your charm collection, and choose how much risk to carry into the next three-race meeting. Complete the standard tour, or take on the Black Book tour for a more demanding route through the same twelve-race structure.<br><br>ODDSTABLE uses only virtual game coins. It contains no real-money betting, deposits, withdrawals, cash prizes, or in-game purchases.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CORE FEATURES<\/h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A complete twelve-race single-player tour, divided into four three-race meetings.<br><\/li><li>Six horses in every race, selected from a larger data-driven horse pool.<br><\/li><li>Fixed odds, public form, track information, and up to three private intel slots per horse.<br><\/li><li>Eight markets unlocked progressively across the tour.<br><\/li><li>Up to three standard tickets or one exclusive ALL IN, with stricter rules imposed by some contracts.<br><\/li><li>Animated races with live order, a true distance-based final 100 metres, and photo finishes for exceptionally close margins.<br><\/li><li>Twenty-four underground contracts across Visitor, Silver Seal, Gold Seal, and Black Gold invitation tiers.<br><\/li><li>Charms, readable ticket settlement, an underground shop, stage bankroll targets, failure states, and completion routes.<br><\/li><li>Standard and Black Book twelve-race tours.<br><\/li><li>Interface languages: English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Japanese, and Korean.<br><\/li><li>Designed for offline play with local saves; no external AI service is used during gameplay.<\/li><\/ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >NO REAL-MONEY GAMBLING NOTICE<\/h2>ODDSTABLE is a fictional, single-player game played entirely with virtual in-game coins. It does not accept real-money bets, deposits, withdrawals, cash conversion, or cash prizes. It contains no in-game purchases. Its fixed odds and ticket systems are game mechanics and are not a gambling service or real-world racing prediction tool.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GENERATIVE AI DISCLOSURE<\/h2>Generative AI tools were used during development to assist with portions of pre-generated artwork, textures, icons, promotional imagery, and localization drafts. All such content was reviewed, edited, selected, and integrated by the developer before release. The game does not connect to external AI services and does not generate AI content during gameplay.","short_description":"Read six-horse fields, lock fixed odds, and survive a twelve-race tour in a single-player offline horse-racing roguelite. Build tickets with virtual coins, take underground contracts, and turn charms into a payout engine. No real-money gambling or in-game purchases.","supported_languages":"English<strong>*<\/strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Japanese<strong>*<\/strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*<\/strong>, Korean<strong>*<\/strong><br><strong>*<\/strong>languages with full audio support","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5000320\/042586168dce953c02257572c46fba519a2d6fed\/header.jpg?t=1793240365","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5000320\/6bcd2752b38bcd001a749227e74f591032e36ea0\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793240365","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5000320\/6bcd2752b38bcd001a749227e74f591032e36ea0\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793240365","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3-6100 or AMD equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Intel HD Graphics 510 or equivalent with Vulkan 1.0 \/ OpenGL 3.3 support<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system.<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10\/11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-6600K or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti, AMD Radeon R7 360, or equivalent<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<br><\/li><li><strong>Sound Card:<\/strong> DirectX-compatible sound card<br><\/li><li><strong>Additional Notes:<\/strong> 1920 × 1080 display recommended.<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><\/ul>"},"developers":["Kai Kai"],"publishers":["Kai Kai"],"price_overview":{"currency":"USD","initial":799,"final":799,"discount_percent":0,"initial_formatted":"","final_formatted":"$7.99"},"packages":[1734485],"package_groups":[{"name":"default","title":"Buy ODDSTABLE","description":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","save_text":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","subs":[{"packageid":1734485,"percent_savings_text":" ","percent_savings":0,"option_text":"ODDSTABLE - $7.99","option_description":"","can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"price_in_cents_with_discount":799}]}],"platforms":{"windows":true,"mac":false,"linux":false},"categories":[{"id":2,"description":"Single-player"},{"id":22,"description":"Steam Achievements"},{"id":67,"description":"Camera Comfort"},{"id":82,"description":"#category_contrast_controls"},{"id":68,"description":"Custom Volume Controls"},{"id":76,"description":"Mouse Only Option"},{"id":80,"description":"#category_playable_at_your_own_pace"},{"id":74,"description":"Playable without Timed Input"},{"id":79,"description":"Save Anytime"},{"id":65,"description":"Subtitle Options"},{"id":77,"description":"Touch Only Option"},{"id":15,"description":"Stats"},{"id":62,"description":"Family Sharing"}],"genres":[{"id":"4","description":"Casual"},{"id":"28","description":"Simulation"},{"id":"18","description":"Sports"},{"id":"2","description":"Strategy"}],"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5000320\/44a9436438f93ac80a05a59f5522f7c6b431f091\/ss_44a9436438f93ac80a05a59f5522f7c6b431f091.600x338.jpg?t=1793240365","path_full":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5000320\/44a9436438f93ac80a05a59f5522f7c6b431f091\/ss_44a9436438f93ac80a05a59f5522f7c6b431f091.1920x1080.jpg?t=1793240365"},{"id":1,"path_thumbnail":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.